# Building structure with the typed creation commands of Go to Command: a section below, a first-child task, a note at the start of the list and a project at the end.
file <<END
Work:
	- Report
		Draft due Friday
	- Slides
Home:
	- Laundry
	- Groceries
		- Milk
		- Eggs
END
keys j <C-p>
type New Section Below
keys <Enter>
type Later
keys <Esc> <C-p>
type New Task as First Child
keys <Enter>
type Archive old drafts
keys <Esc> <C-p>
type New Note at Start
keys <Enter>
type Top note
keys <Esc> G <C-p>
type New Project at End
keys <Enter>
type Bulk
keys <Esc>
see ▌     Bulk:
see       - Archive old drafts
quit
saved <<END
Work:
	- Report
		Draft due Friday
	Later @section
		Top note
		- Archive old drafts
	- Slides
Home:
	- Laundry
	- Groceries
		- Milk
		- Eggs
		Bulk:
END
